OL,3,GNEWSAHydrogen plant plans approved on
OL,4,Aold nuclear site
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a green hydrogen plans at the
OL,7,Fsite of a former nuclear power station
OL,8,Fin southern Scotland have been
OL,9,Fapproved, according to the firm hoping
OL,10,Fto build it.
OL,12,FGavin Catto, chief executive of Green
OL,13,FCat Hydrogen (GCH), said it was a
OL,14,F"major milestone" for its project at
OL,15,FChapelcross near Annan which would
OL,16,Fcreate dozens of jobs.
OL,18,FA plan for turning the area into a
OL,19,F"green energy hub" was unveiled in
OL,20,F2024, backed by funding from the
OL,21,FScottish and UK governments.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
